* Wed Sep 17 2025 Ruidong Tian <tianruidong@linux.alibaba.com> [6.6.102-5_rc2%%DIST%%]
- anolis: kernel-spec: mm: Enable file mTHP optimization in default cmdline (Weilin Tong)
- riscv: Extend sv39 linear mapping max size to 128G (Stuart Menefy)
- riscv: Remove redundant restriction on memory size (Stuart Menefy)
- ext4: fix error pointer dereference in ext4_mb_load_buddy_gfp() (Dan Carpenter)
- EDAC/{skx_common,i10nm}: Use scnprintf() for safer buffer handling (Wang Haoran)
- EDAC/i10nm: Add Intel Granite Rapids-D support (Qiuxu Zhuo)
