- EDAC/{skx_common,i10nm}: Structure the per-channel RRL registers (Qiuxu Zhuo)
- EDAC/i10nm: Explicitly set the modes of the RRL register sets (Qiuxu Zhuo)
- EDAC/{i10nm,skx,skx_common}: Support UV systems (Kyle Meyer)
